          "smithy.api#httpError": 404,
          "smithy.api#documentation": "The table does not exist (HTTP 404 `TableNotFound`; Delete Table answers `ResourceNotFound`). Entity operations list `TableEntityNotFound` first, so their `ResourceNotFound` is the missing entity.",
